      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: Revenues exceed analysts expectations while EPS lags behind",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹4.60 (up from ₹2.51 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹34.9b (up 20% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.07b (up 84% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 3.1% (up from 2.0% in FY 2025). Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 6.8%. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates by 39%. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 61% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
