      "title": "Greaves Cotton Limited Announces Chief Financial Officer Changes, Effective March 19, 2026",
      "body": "the Board of Directors of Greaves Cotton Limited, at its Meeting held on 13th March, 2026, has, inter alia considered, approved and taken on record the following: Resignation submitted by Mrs. Akhila Balachandar vide letter dated 19th February, 2026 from the position of Chief Financial Officer of the Company, citing personal reasons and other priorities, with effect from 19th March, 2026. On the recommendation of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee & Audit Committee, approved the appointment of Mr. Manish Poddar as the Group Chief Financial Officer with effect from 19th March, 2026. Mr. Manish Poddar has over 25 years of experience in finance, treasury, investor relations, governance and strategic business partnering. He has previously served as Chief Financial Officer of GMM Pfaudle",
